  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'm sure most players have experienced this one before, when trying to pick up a small object on the floor 3 meters away from them, or interacting with a small trigger. No matter how much you wave your hand around in the general direction of the object, it almost never seems to light up and be considered interactable.\nWell I suggest making a shortcut, of some sorts (let's say double pressing your grip button or something like that) which would temporarily cast a line from your dominant hand, making it easier to line up whatever you wanna interact with.",
